/-!
# The covered Suzuki branch of the Bender argument

The genuine ambient configuration excludes the Suzuki cover: its component
image has order eight, while the TI Sylow displacement bound bounds the
whole Sylow image by the cover center, of order at most four. The proof
constructs the omega identity, fusion mover, kernel, TI condition and full
Sylow displacement bound from the actual source maps and inclusions.

`CoveredCase.center_eq_bot` supplies the center-free input to the unchanged
Bender/J1 route. Only the literal earlier 16.1/I.2 cover reduction and
center-order bound remain explicit for the source assembly owner. All
previous cover and actor-normality diagnostics remain re-exported.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, 16.5.1, printed pp.1193–1195; 16.1.2, p.1170;
I.2.2(4), p.409, manuscript of 1 March 2004.
-/
